# Scenario
Two strangers. One conversation. One profile they never meant to reveal. A breakfast terrace screenshot captured a chat between two guests before it could disappear. Somewhere in that conversation is enough to track down an account nobody was supposed to find.

# Tools Used
- TryHackMe Task Files (conversation.png)
- Python 3 (hashlib)
